#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD2249 expect=violation domain=TS
#note "Row 2 is the ACTSUB record and spells its value out as 'ONE HUNDRED TWENTY' instead of a whole number -> fires. Row 1 is a well-formed ACTSUB record and must stay clean."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=2 TSPARMCD=ACTSUB TSVAL="ONE HUNDRED TWENTY"
dataset TS label="Trial Summary"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col TSSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col TSPARMCD type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter Short Name"
col TSPARM   type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter"
col TSVAL    type=Char label="Parameter Value"
---
S1 | TS | 1 | ACTSUB | Actual Number of Subjects | 120
S1 | TS | 2 | ACTSUB | Actual Number of Subjects | ONE HUNDRED TWENTY
